          </p>

          <p>
            Watch which Six Star you are pricing. The newer Six Star Complete Whey Protein Plus that Amazon sells is a different, sustained-release product, and at $44.99 for about 20 scoops it is the most expensive option in the table per gram of protein. On the day we checked, the cheaper way to buy a 30 g Iovate scoop on Amazon was MuscleTech's Nitro-Tech 4 lb tub, at about $1.16 per 25 g with 3 g of creatine included, as our <a href="/muscletech-protein-powder-review/">MuscleTech protein powder review</a> explains.
